-- examples/slo/slo-requests.rofl — THE REQUESTS, generated once by a script from the timeline in
-- examples/slo/README.md. The script is not kept: the expected sums in
-- examples/checks/agg-slo-demo-check.rofl were computed by it, apart from the rules, so they
-- are an independent oracle. Time is minutes. req(Id, Service, T, Weight): a read weighs 1, a write 4.
-- failed(Id) and lat(Id, Milliseconds) are the outcome.
